{"unit_id":"kyrsieger__dsh-up-session#card-zh","repo":"kyrsieger/dsh-up-session","commit":"74deef4172c08ad0003b862478fafe473a8061a3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-up-session 是面向 DSH Web 侧边栏的会话整理插件：它在工作区列表顶部汇总各工作区的置顶会话，并按最近活动列出未置顶的最近会话。用户可打开会话、置顶或取消置顶、归档，并查看运行状态；最近列表每次可多显示五条。设置弹窗可分别隐藏两个分组，并控制打开会话时是否展开所属工作区。适合需要快速回到常用或近期会话的用户；偏好保存在浏览器本地，无需额外服务配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:916-1005","client.js:1017-1070","client.js:1928-2003"]}
{"unit_id":"kyrsieger__dsh-up-session#card-en","repo":"kyrsieger/dsh-up-session","commit":"74deef4172c08ad0003b862478fafe473a8061a3","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-up-session adds pinned and recent groups to the DSH Web sidebar. It gathers pinned sessions across workspaces and sorts unpinned sessions by activity. Users can open, pin, unpin, or archive sessions and see live status. Settings hide either group and control workspace expansion on open.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:916-1005","client.js:1017-1070","client.js:1928-2003"]}
