{"unit_id":"kyrsieger__dsh-up-session#feature-pinned","repo":"kyrsieger/dsh-up-session","commit":"74deef4172c08ad0003b862478fafe473a8061a3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-up-session 的功能「置顶会话汇总」：把各工作区中未归档的置顶会话集中显示，按最近活动排序。点击会话行可打开，会话行操作可取消置顶或归档。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:946-982","client.js:1334-1388"]}
{"unit_id":"kyrsieger__dsh-up-session#feature-recent","repo":"kyrsieger/dsh-up-session","commit":"74deef4172c08ad0003b862478fafe473a8061a3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-up-session 的功能「最近会话」：列出未归档且未置顶的普通会话，按最近活动排序，默认展示五条。点击“展开更多”每次增加五条，全部显示后可收起。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:984-1005","client.js:1396-1477"]}
{"unit_id":"kyrsieger__dsh-up-session#feature-status","repo":"kyrsieger/dsh-up-session","commit":"74deef4172c08ad0003b862478fafe473a8061a3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-up-session 的功能「会话状态标记」：在置顶和最近列表中显示等待处理、运行中或未查看完成状态，并从 DSH 会话状态数据生成标记。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:600-670","client.js:1246-1316"]}
{"unit_id":"kyrsieger__dsh-up-session#feature-settings_archive","repo":"kyrsieger/dsh-up-session","commit":"74deef4172c08ad0003b862478fafe473a8061a3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-up-session 的功能「列表设置与安全归档确认」：设置弹窗可隐藏置顶区或最近区，并控制打开会话时是否展开工作区；归档遇到活动会话时可查看活动并确认停止后归档。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1017-1070","client.js:1525-1630","client.js:1636-1785"]}
